{
  "the-body": {
    "title": "The body",
    "summary": "Alone, the body parts are native words — くち, め, て, あし, からだ — but in many compounds they switch to on readings: 人口 じんこう, 目的 もくてき, 手話 しゅわ. 足 is also a verb: 足りる, to be enough, and 足す, to add.",
