  "self-and-others": {
    "title": "Self and others",
    "summary": "私 is わたし in conversation and わたくし when you need to sound formal: one kanji, two words. 者 means person too, but it is humble or bookish and lives in compounds like 学者 and 読者; the everyday word for a person is still 人.",
