  "morning-to-night": {
    "title": "Morning to night",
    "summary": "Each time of day has a native reading on its own and an on reading in compounds: あさ and ちょう, ひる and ちゅう, よる and や. 夕べ is written with the evening kanji, but in conversation it usually means last night.",
