  "weeks-and-clocks": {
    "title": "Weeks, clocks and times",
    "summary": "度 counts both times and degrees: 一度 is once, and in a weather forecast 三十度 is thirty degrees. 代 is a stand-in, an era, or a bill — 時代 is a period of history, 電気代 is what you pay for electricity.",
