  "the-seasons": {
    "title": "The four seasons",
    "summary": "Each season is a native word on its own — はる, なつ, あき, ふゆ — and all four on readings line up in 春夏秋冬, しゅんかしゅうとう. 風 and 風邪 are both read かぜ: one is the wind, the other a cold.",
