  "colours": {
    "title": "Colours",
    "summary": "The oldest colour words — 赤い, 青い, 黒い, and 白い from N5 — are i-adjectives; most of the rest are nouns built on 色, like 茶色 and 水色. 青 covers green as well as blue, which is why a green traffic light is called 青.",
